@startuml campaign_lifecycle
title Campaign lifecycle

[*] --> Deployment : B deploys SC\nwith PK_B and config

Deployment --> Funded : B deposits totalDst\ninto SC

Funded --> Enrollment : Campaign open

state Enrollment {
    state "Sender enrollment" as SE
    state "Verifier enrollment" as VE
    SE : S sends Enc(PK_S, PK_B)
    SE : B delivers K_enc
    VE : V sends Enc(PK_V, PK_B)
    VE : B delivers K_dec
}

Enrollment --> BondPayment : Actors enrolled

state "Bond payment" as BondPayment {
    state "Sender bond" as SB
    state "Verifier bond" as VB
    SB : S deposits\nmaxDataPerSender ×\ndataSenderBondPerData
    VB : V deposits\nmaxDataPerVerifierPerBond ×\ndataVerifierBondPerData
}

BondPayment --> Operating : Bonds deposited

state "Operating" as Operating {
    state "Data submission" as DS
    state "Verification\n(per datum)" as Ver
    DS : S uploads to IPFS\nand submits CID_ciphered
    DS -right-> Ver : Event emitted
    Ver : Slot assignment\nVerification\nMajority check\nReward / Forfeit
    Ver -left-> DS : Next submission
}

Operating --> Closed : Campaign thresholds met\nor B closes manually

Closed --> [*]

note right of Operating
  Enrollment and bond
  payment can continue
  during the operating
  phase for new actors.
end note

@enduml
